  "an2.151:1.1": "bhikkhave santhārā. ",
  "an2.151:1.2": "Katame dve? ",
  "an2.151:1.3": "Āmisa-santhāro ca dhamma-santhāro ca. ",
  "an2.151:1.4": "Ime kho . . . pe . . . dhamma-santhāro ti. 2. Dve 'me ",
  "an2.151:1.5": "",
